{"cases":[{"a":"HTTPS://Example.COM/Path","b":"https://example.com/Path","expect":"exact","id":"basic-case","note":"scheme/host case normalized; path case preserved"},{"a":"https://example.com:443/a","b":"https://example.com/a","expect":"exact","id":"basic-default-port","note":"default port dropped"},{"a":"https://example.com:8443/a","b":"https://example.com/a","expect":"distinct","id":"basic-nondefault-port","note":"non-default port is identity"},{"a":"https://example.com/a/","b":"https://example.com/a","expect":"exact","id":"basic-trailing-slash","note":"trailing slash normalized"},{"a":"https://example.com","b":"https://example.com/","expect":"exact","id":"basic-root-slash","note":"empty path becomes /"},{"a":"https://example.com/p?b=2&a=1","b":"https://example.com/p?a=1&b=2","expect":"exact","id":"basic-param-order","note":"query params sorted"},{"a":"https://example.com/article#section-2","b":"https://example.com/article","expect":"exact","id":"basic-fragment-anchor","note":"generic fragment is a pure anchor, dropped"},{"a":"https://example.com/article#:~:text=hello","b":"https://example.com/article","expect":"exact","id":"basic-scroll-to-text","note":"scroll-to-text fragment dropped like any anchor"},{"a":"https://example.com/a","b":"https://example.com/b","expect":"distinct","id":"basic-different-path","note":"different paths are different documents"},{"a":"https://example.com/p?page=1","b":"https://example.com/p?page=2","expect":"distinct","id":"basic-different-param","note":"meaningful params are identity"},{"a":"  https://example.com/a  ","b":"https://example.com/a","expect":"exact","id":"basic-whitespace","note":"surrounding whitespace trimmed"},{"a":"https://example.com/p?color=red","b":"https://example.com/p?color=blue","expect":"distinct","id":"basic-unknown-param","note":"unknown params are kept, not guessed away"},{"a":"https://api.example.com/a","b":"https://example.com/a","expect":"distinct","id":"basic-subdomain","note":"arbitrary subdomains are different documents"},{"a":"http://example.com/a","b":"https://example.com/a","expect":"distinct","id":"basic-scheme","note":"http vs https differ (precision-safe)"},{"a":"https://news.example/story?utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=social","b":"https://news.example/story","expect":"exact","id":"track-utm","note":"utm_* stripped"},{"a":"https://news.example/story?fbclid=IwAR123abc","b":"https://news.example/story","expect":"exact","id":"track-fbclid","note":"fbclid stripped"},{"a":"https://shop.example/item?id=42&gclid=abc","b":"https://shop.example/item?id=42","expect":"exact","id":"track-gclid-keeps-id","note":"gclid stripped, real param kept"},{"a":"https://example.com/lp?msclkid=zzz&x=1","b":"https://example.com/lp?x=1","expect":"exact","id":"track-msclkid","note":"msclkid stripped"},{"a":"https://example.com/nl?mc_cid=aa11&mc_eid=bb22","b":"https://example.com/nl","expect":"exact","id":"track-mailchimp","note":"mc_cid/mc_eid stripped"},{"a":"https://blog.example/post?ref=newsletter","b":"https://blog.example/post","expect":"exact","id":"track-ref-generic","note":"ref stripped off GitHub"},{"a":"https://example.com/x?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","b":"https://example.com/x","expect":"exact","id":"track-ref-src","note":"ref_src stripped"},{"a":"https://a.example/p?utm_campaign=z&fbclid=q","b":"https://a.example/p?utm_source=y","expect":"exact","id":"track-both-dirty","note":"different tracker sets, same clean identity"},{"a":"https://example.com/p?utm_source=x&id=1","b":"https://example.com/p?id=2","expect":"distinct","id":"track-plus-content-diff","note":"trackers stripped but content param still differs"},{"a":"https://m.example.com/news/1","b":"https://example.com/news/1","expect":"fuzzy","id":"amp-m-host","note":"m. host variant collapses only in fuzzy"},{"a":"https://mobile.example.com/a","b":"https://example.com/a","expect":"fuzzy","id":"amp-mobile-host","note":"mobile. host variant"},{"a":"https://www.example.com/a","b":"https://example.com/a","expect":"fuzzy","id":"amp-www-host","note":"www kept in exact, stripped in fuzzy"},{"a":"https://example.com/news/1/amp","b":"https://example.com/news/1","expect":"fuzzy","id":"amp-path","note":"/amp path suffix is a variant, not identity"},{"a":"https://example.com/news/1?amp=1","b":"https://example.com/news/1","expect":"fuzzy","id":"amp-param","note":"amp param kept in exact, dropped in fuzzy"},{"a":"https://example.com/n?output=amp","b":"https://example.com/n","expect":"fuzzy","id":"amp-output","note":"output=amp marker"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit?usp=sharing","b":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit","expect":"exact","id":"gdoc-usp","note":"sharing params never enter the key"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/document/u/0/d/DOCAAA111/edit","b":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit","expect":"exact","id":"gdoc-u0","note":"multi-account /u/0/ segment is not identity"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit#heading=h.abc123","b":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit","expect":"fuzzy","id":"gdoc-heading","note":"heading anchor is view state: fuzzy, NOT exact"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit#heading=h.aaa","b":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit#heading=h.bbb","expect":"fuzzy","id":"gdoc-two-headings","note":"two heading anchors of one doc"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit","b":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/view","expect":"fuzzy","id":"gdoc-edit-vs-view","note":"mode tail differs, document same"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit","b":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCBBB222/edit","expect":"distinct","id":"gdoc-distinct","note":"PRECISION: two different docs must never merge"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=123456&rtpof=true&sd=true","b":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/DOCAAA111/edit","expect":"exact","id":"gdoc-junk-params","note":"usp/ouid/rtpof/sd ignored wholesale"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/SAMEID999/edit","b":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SAMEID999/edit","expect":"distinct","id":"gdoc-vs-sheet-same-id","note":"same ID string, different app = different document"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit?usp=sharing#gid=0","b":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit#gid=0","expect":"exact","id":"sheet-same-gid","note":"same sheet tab"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit#gid=0","b":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit#gid=123456","expect":"fuzzy","id":"sheet-diff-gid","note":"PRECISION: different gid = fuzzy, NOT exact"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit#gid=0","b":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit","expect":"fuzzy","id":"sheet-gid-vs-none","note":"absent gid is ambiguous, so not exact"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit#gid=0&range=A1:B2","b":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit#gid=0","expect":"exact","id":"sheet-range-ignored","note":"cell range is a selection (like scroll), not identity"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit?gid=42#gid=42","b":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit#gid=42","expect":"exact","id":"sheet-query-gid","note":"query-mirrored gid agrees with fragment gid"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETAAA111/edit#gid=0","b":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SHEETBBB222/edit#gid=0","expect":"distinct","id":"sheet-distinct","note":"PRECISION: two different workbooks"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/SLIDESAAA111/edit?usp=sharing","b":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/SLIDESAAA111/edit","expect":"exact","id":"slides-usp","note":"same deck"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/SLIDESAAA111/edit#slide=id.g123abc","b":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/SLIDESAAA111/edit","expect":"fuzzy","id":"slides-anchor","note":"slide anchor is view state"},{"a":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/SLIDESAAA111/present","b":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/SLIDESAAA111/edit","expect":"fuzzy","id":"slides-present-vs-edit","note":"present mode vs edit mode"},{"a":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/FILEAAA111/view?usp=sharing","b":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/FILEAAA111/view","expect":"exact","id":"drive-usp","note":"same Drive file"},{"a":"https://drive.google.com/open?id=FILEAAA111","b":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/FILEAAA111/view","expect":"exact","id":"drive-open-form","note":"/open?id= is the same file as /file/d/"},{"a":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/FILEAAA111/preview","b":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/FILEAAA111/view","expect":"exact","id":"drive-preview-vs-view","note":"Drive keys on the file ID alone"},{"a":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/FILEAAA111/view","b":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/FILEBBB222/view","expect":"distinct","id":"drive-distinct","note":"PRECISION: two different files"},{"a":"https://www.notion.so/My-Project-Plan-1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d","b":"https://www.notion.so/1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d","expect":"exact","id":"notion-slug-vs-bare","note":"title slug is not identity, the 32-hex ID is"},{"a":"https://www.notion.so/My-Project-Plan-1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d?pvs=4","b":"https://www.notion.so/1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d","expect":"exact","id":"notion-pvs","note":"pvs param ignored"},{"a":"https://acme.notion.site/My-Page-1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d","b":"https://www.notion.so/1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d","expect":"exact","id":"notion-site-subdomain","note":"same page via workspace notion.site domain"},{"a":"https://www.notion.so/1a2b3c4d-5e6f-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d","b":"https://www.notion.so/1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d","expect":"exact","id":"notion-dashed-uuid","note":"dashed UUID form normalizes to the bare ID"},{"a":"https://www.notion.so/1A2B3C4D5E6F7A8B9C0D1E2F3A4B5C6D","b":"https://www.notion.so/1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d","expect":"exact","id":"notion-id-case","note":"hex IDs are case-insensitive"},{"a":"https://www.notion.so/Old-Title-1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d","b":"https://www.notion.so/New-Title-1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d","expect":"exact","id":"notion-title-change","note":"renamed page, same ID"},{"a":"https://www.notion.so/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa","b":"https://www.notion.so/bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb","expect":"distinct","id":"notion-distinct","note":"PRECISION: two different pages"},{"a":"https://www.notion.so/1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d-Notes","b":"https://www.notion.so/1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d","expect":"distinct","id":"notion-id-not-at-end","note":"PRECISION: ID not in the canonical trailing position is not guessed; generic keys keep them apart"},{"a":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/src/app.ts?utm_source=x","b":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/src/app.ts","expect":"exact","id":"gh-blob-utm","note":"same file, tracker stripped"},{"a":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/src/app.ts#L12","b":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/src/app.ts","expect":"fuzzy","id":"gh-line-anchor","note":"PRECISION: line anchor is view state, NOT an exact duplicate"},{"a":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/src/app.ts#L12","b":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/src/app.ts#L30-L40","expect":"fuzzy","id":"gh-two-anchors","note":"two line anchors of one file"},{"a":"https://github.com/acme/widgets.git","b":"https://github.com/acme/widgets","expect":"exact","id":"gh-repo-git-suffix","note":".git suffix normalized"},{"a":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/","b":"https://github.com/acme/widgets","expect":"exact","id":"gh-repo-trailing","note":"repo trailing slash"},{"a":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/README.md?plain=1","b":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/README.md","expect":"fuzzy","id":"gh-plain-param","note":"plain=1 is a view mode: kept in exact, dropped in fuzzy"},{"a":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/tree/main?ref=dev","b":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/tree/main","expect":"distinct","id":"gh-ref-param","note":"ref is NOT stripped on GitHub (can carry branch state)"},{"a":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/src/a.ts","b":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/src/b.ts","expect":"distinct","id":"gh-distinct-files","note":"different files"},{"a":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/dev/src/app.ts","b":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/src/app.ts","expect":"distinct","id":"gh-distinct-branch","note":"same path on different branches is a different document"},{"a":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/tree/main/src","b":"https://github.com/acme/widgets/blob/main/src/app.ts","expect":"distinct","id":"gh-tree-vs-blob","note":"directory listing vs file"},{"a":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY123/My-Design?t=abcdef-1","b":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY123/My-Design","expect":"exact","id":"figma-t-param","note":"share timestamp t is not identity"},{"a":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY123/My-Design?node-id=1-2","b":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY123/My-Design?node-id=3-4","expect":"fuzzy","id":"figma-node-diff","note":"PRECISION: different selected node = fuzzy, NOT exact"},{"a":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY123/My-Design?node-id=1-2","b":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY123/My-Design","expect":"fuzzy","id":"figma-node-vs-none","note":"node selected vs file root"},{"a":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY123/My-Design","b":"https://www.figma.com/file/FIGKEY123/My-Design","expect":"fuzzy","id":"figma-design-vs-file","note":"mode differs, file same"},{"a":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY123/My-Design?page-id=0%3A1","b":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY123/My-Design?page-id=2%3A3","expect":"fuzzy","id":"figma-page-diff","note":"different canvas page of one file"},{"a":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY123/My-Design","b":"https://www.figma.com/design/FIGKEY999/Other-Design","expect":"distinct","id":"figma-distinct","note":"PRECISION: two different files"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ","b":"https://youtu.be/dQw4w9WgXcQ","expect":"exact","id":"yt-watch-vs-shortlink","note":"youtu.be is the watch page"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&si=AbCdEfGh","b":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ","expect":"exact","id":"yt-si-tracker","note":"si share id stripped on YouTube"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&feature=share","b":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ","expect":"exact","id":"yt-feature-param","note":"non-state params do not affect watch identity"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&t=30","b":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&t=120","expect":"fuzzy","id":"yt-t-diff","note":"different playback position: fuzzy, NOT exact"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&t=1m30s","b":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&t=90s","expect":"exact","id":"yt-t-formats","note":"timestamps normalize to seconds (90)"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&t=45","b":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ","expect":"fuzzy","id":"yt-t-vs-none","note":"positioned vs unpositioned"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&list=PLAAA111","b":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&list=PLBBB222","expect":"fuzzy","id":"yt-list-diff","note":"different playlist context, same video"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/dQw4w9WgXcQ","b":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ","expect":"fuzzy","id":"yt-shorts-vs-watch","note":"same video, different UI"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ","b":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ","expect":"fuzzy","id":"yt-embed-vs-watch","note":"embed form of the same video"},{"a":"https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ","b":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ","expect":"exact","id":"yt-music-host","note":"music.youtube.com watch is the same video"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ","b":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9bZkp7q19f0","expect":"distinct","id":"yt-distinct","note":"PRECISION: two different videos"},{"a":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLABC123&utm_source=x","b":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLABC123","expect":"exact","id":"yt-playlist","note":"playlist identity is the list ID"},{"a":"https://www.google.com/search?q=cats","b":"https://www.google.com/search?q=dogs","expect":"distinct","id":"search-diff-q","note":"PRECISION: different queries are different documents"},{"a":"https://www.google.com/search?q=cats&utm_source=x&fbclid=y","b":"https://www.google.com/search?q=cats","expect":"exact","id":"search-same-q-trackers","note":"same query under trackers"},{"a":"https://www.google.com/search?q=cats&hl=en","b":"https://www.google.com/search?hl=en&q=cats","expect":"exact","id":"search-param-order","note":"param order irrelevant"},{"a":"https://www.bing.com/search?q=alpha","b":"https://www.bing.com/search?q=beta","expect":"distinct","id":"search-bing-diff-q","note":"Bing queries are identity too"},{"a":"https://duckduckgo.com/?q=hello+world","b":"https://duckduckgo.com/?q=hello%20world","expect":"exact","id":"search-ddg-encoding","note":"+ and %20 decode to the same query"},{"a":"about:blank","b":"about:blank","expect":"exact","id":"edge-about-blank","note":"non-http(s) input is its own key (engine excludes it)"},{"a":"chrome://extensions/","b":"chrome://extensions/","expect":"exact","id":"edge-chrome-page","note":"browser pages are identity keys (engine excludes them)"},{"a":"not a url","b":"not a url","expect":"exact","id":"edge-unparseable","note":"unparseable input returns trimmed, both tiers"},{"a":"ftp://example.com/file","b":"ftp://example.com/file","expect":"exact","id":"edge-ftp","note":"non-http(s) scheme is identity-keyed"}],"description":"Golden corpus for the M1 canonicalizer. Each case pairs two URLs and the expected relationship of their canonical keys: exact (same exactKey: same document, same view/state), fuzzy (different exactKey, same fuzzyKey: same document, different view/state — never auto-close), distinct (both keys differ). Consumed by BOTH cargo test (core/tests/corpus.rs) and vitest (tests/canonicalize.test.ts) to prove Rust/TS bit-for-bit parity. Precision bar: no case may be classified exact unless it is in the exact group.","version":1}